    "OpenSSH may execute local commands from Match exec or read files that could not be inspected. Continue only if you trust this configuration and every included file. No SSH connection is opened during resolution.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenSSH may execute local commands from Match exec or read files that could not be inspected. Continue only if you trust this configuration and every included file. No SSH connection is opened during resolution."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenSSH 可能执行 Match exec 中的本地命令，或读取无法检查的文件。只有信任此配置及其所有包含文件时才应继续。解析期间不会建立 SSH 连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original configuration is never modified. This is a one-time import, not background synchronization.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
