            "value": "不会修改原始配置。这是一次性导入，不会在后台同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenSSH known_hosts is not imported. Tamio keeps its own host-key verification and records a key on first connection; insecure OpenSSH trust settings are not copied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
