    "Agents (Claude Code, Codex, any MCP client) can list your servers and their live status, and, when you approve, run commands and manage servers, keys, snippets and port forwards. They never get passwords or private keys.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agents (Claude Code, Codex, any MCP client) can list your servers and their live status, and, when you approve, run commands and manage servers, keys, snippets and port forwards. They never get passwords or private keys."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "智能体（Claude Code、Codex 或任何 MCP 客户端）可以列出你的服务器及其实时状态，并在你批准后运行命令、管理服务器、密钥、代码片段和端口转发。它们永远拿不到密码或私钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents have not run or changed anything here yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
