    "Every command and change asks you first. “Allow for 1 Hour” lets that agent go on without asking until then; “Always Allow” lets it work on its own, while you are away, until you revoke it here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every command and change asks you first. “Allow for 1 Hour” lets that agent go on without asking until then; “Always Allow” lets it work on its own, while you are away, until you revoke it here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每条命令和更改都会先询问你。“允许 1 小时”让该智能体在此期间无需询问；“始终允许”让它在你不在时也能自行工作，直到你在这里撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every server with a password or key shows its load, CPU, memory, disk and traffic, over a connection of its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every server with a password or key shows its load, CPU, memory, disk and traffic, over a connection of its own."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每台有密码或密钥的服务器都会通过独立连接显示其负载、CPU、内存、磁盘和流量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
