    "Files follows the terminal's folder. Each new terminal types a line that has bash, zsh or fish tell Tamio its folder at every prompt; nothing is changed on the server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Files follows the terminal's folder. Each new terminal types a line that has bash, zsh or fish tell Tamio its folder at every prompt; nothing is changed on the server."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“文件”会跟随终端所在的文件夹。每个新终端都会输入一行命令，让 bash、zsh 或 fish 在每次显示提示符时告诉 Tamio 当前文件夹；服务器上不会有任何改动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
