    "On unless you turn it off, so your servers and what agents did on them are never lost with a Mac. Everything is encrypted on this device before it goes to iCloud, under a passphrase kept in your iCloud Keychain, so your other Macs sync by themselves. Apple cannot read it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On unless you turn it off, so your servers and what agents did on them are never lost with a Mac. Everything is encrypted on this device before it goes to iCloud, under a passphrase kept in your iCloud Keychain, so your other Macs sync by themselves. Apple cannot read it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认开启，这样你的服务器以及智能体在上面所做的事就不会随一台 Mac 丢失。所有内容在离开此设备前都会用保存在 iCloud 钥匙串中的口令加密，因此你的其他 Mac 会自动同步。Apple 无法读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
